---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="SolidWorks Agent | Wang">
  <p class="eyebrow">2026 · ENGINEERING PROJECT</p>
  <h1>Agent × MCP × SolidWorks</h1>
  <p class="lead">一个面向机械工程图自动化的 Agent 系统：从 SolidWorks 3D 模型提取可证明的工程事实，生成绘图计划，再通过原生 SolidWorks API 创建并验证二维工程图。</p>

  <div class="cta">
    <a class="button" href="/projects">← Projects</a>
    <a class="button" href="https://github.com/wwwyyyhhh0520">GitHub</a>
  </div>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">MOTIVATION</p><h2>From CAD scripts to engineering agents</h2></div>
    <div class="card">
      <p>传统 CAD 自动化通常依赖一次性脚本，而工程知识分散在工程师经验、历史图纸和项目规范中。本项目尝试把机械设计流程转化为可复用的 AI 工程能力。</p>
      <div class="architecture"><span>Requirement</span><b>↓</b><span>Semantic Facts</span><b>↓</b><span>Drawing Plan</span><b>↓</b><span>SolidWorks Native Execution</span><b>↓</b><span>Validation</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">ARCHITECTURE</p><h2>Agent, Skill and MCP</h2></div>
    <div class="project-card">
      <div>
        <h3>Engineering workflow orchestration</h3>
        <p>Agent 负责理解任务和协调执行；Skill 封装工程流程、模板和规则；MCP 提供 Agent 与外部工具之间的标准连接方式。</p>
        <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Agent</span><span class="tag">Skill</span><span class="tag">MCP</span><span class="tag">SolidWorks API</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="architecture"><span>User</span><b>↓</b><span>Agent</span><b>↓</b><span>Skill Workflow</span><b>↓</b><span>MCP Tools</span><b>↓</b><span>SolidWorks Runtime</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">REUSABLE ASSET</p><h2>machining-part-design-workflow Skill</h2></div>
    <div class="card">
      <p>项目沉淀的不只是代码，而是一套可交接的工程工作流：</p>
      <pre>machining-part-design-workflow
├── SKILL.md
├── templates
├── prompts
├── examples
├── docs
└── mcp</pre>
      <p>其他工程师可以基于相同输入模板、执行规则和报告格式复用该能力。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">PIPELINE</p><h2>3D model → validated drawing</h2></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><p class="kicker">01 · Inspect</p><h3>Model Semantics</h3><p>提取 feature、topology、hole、包围范围和工程证据。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><p class="kicker">02 · Prove</p><h3>Engineering Facts</h3><p>尺寸必须来自模型事实，不由语言模型猜测。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><p class="kicker">03 · Plan</p><h3>Drawing Planning</h3><p>生成视图、标注和执行计划。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><p class="kicker">04 · Execute</p><h3>Native CAD Objects</h3><p>调用 SolidWorks 原生 dimension 与 callout API。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><p class="kicker">05 · Validate</p><h3>Save / Reopen</h3><p>验证原生对象和值的持久化。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><p class="kicker">06 · Deliver</p><h3>Engineering Package</h3><p>输出 CAD、STEP、图纸、报告和评审资料。</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">ARCHITECTURE EVOLUTION</p><h2>From inline implementation to reusable pipeline</h2></div>
    <div class="card">
      <pre>Inline Annotation Logic
          ↓
ExecuteAnnotationCreation Router
          ↓
AnnotationExecutionRequest
          ↓
ResolvedAnnotationExecutionContext
          ↓
OverallExecutionContext
          ↓
Probe → Commit → Registration</pre>
      <p>迁移过程中保持单一算法来源，不复制 candidate search、probe 或 validation 逻辑。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING CHALLENGES</p><h2>Validation lessons</h2></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><h3>Semantic Frame Evidence</h3><p>旧 loader 未识别 nested exact-envelope 数据结构。通过适配已有 semantic artifact 解决，而不是重新计算几何。</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>SolidWorks COM Lifecycle</h3><p>AddHoleCallout2 调用验证过程中发现同步 COM 生命周期问题，采用诊断记录和 fail-closed 策略。</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">DELIVERY</p><h2>Final project package</h2></div>
    <div class="card">
      <ul>
        <li>机加件数字设计工作流</li>
        <li>machining-part-design-workflow Skill 包</li>
        <li>需求、CAD 对比、工程图、评审模板</li>
        <li>MCP / Script 编排入口说明</li>
        <li>CAD、STEP、工程图和设计评审资料</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
